  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2989f6b7554baf142b3f807ffa71cecf, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialEntriesContainer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialEntries:
  - id: 0
    tutorialEntryText: As a carrier, your task is to carry the souls of the dead
      to the afterlife and ensure if their ticket and personal data are valid.
  - id: 1
    tutorialEntryText: Passengers with invalid tickets or incorrect information are
      not allowed to travel to the afterlife.
  - id: 2
    tutorialEntryText: Any violation of the rules will be reported to the Afterlife
      Legal Department and may result in consequences.
  - id: 3
    tutorialEntryText: By interacting with Diary on your desk you can read short
      recap about what happened earlier. Any thoughts that come to your mind about
      the passengers you spoke with will be recorded here.
